<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ 99-day T-bills yield 7.733 percent at tender.</title>
<headline>NZ 99-day T-bills yield 7.733 percent at tender.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average yield for NZ$75 million of 99-day treasury bills at Monday's tender was 7.733 percent versus 7.723 percent for the NZ$75 million of a similar maturity at last week's tender, the Reserve Bank said.</p>
<p>Bids totalled NZ$222 million.</p>
